<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?><?xml-stylesheet href="http://www.blogger.com/styles/atom.css" type="text/css"?><feed xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom' xmlns:openSearch='http://a9.com/-/spec/opensearchrss/1.0/' xmlns:gd="http://schemas.google.com/g/2005"><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post4620668461684248853..comments</id><updated>2017-04-13T04:47:21.148-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Comments on Pro Libertate: The Enforcement Caste&#39;s War on Women </title><link rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#feed' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/feeds/comments/default'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4620668461684248853/comments/default'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/09/the-enforcement-castes-war-on-women.html'/><link rel="hub" href="http://pubsubhubbub.appspot.com/"/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='19' src='http://3.bp.blogspot.com/-5rhFUXs_62I/VgVL2E3rMII/AAAAAAAAMJ4/cjJOyI7W208/s220/Photo%2BRon%2BPaul%2BLiberty%2BReport.jpg'/></author><generator version='7.00' uri='http://www.blogger.com'>Blogger</generator><openSearch:totalResults>13</openSearch:totalResults><openSearch:startIndex>1</openSearch:startIndex><openSearch:itemsPerPage>25</openSearch:itemsPerPage><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8654166238362972126</id><published>2013-09-18T17:47:17.247-06:00</published><updated>2013-09-18T17:47:17.247-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Mark, &#xa;&#xa;My heart goes out to you and your family. ...</title><content type='html'>Mark, &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;My heart goes out to you and your family. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I love Philadelphia (I&amp;#39;m in the minority, I know) but as a whole Philly is absolutely LOADED with psychotic cops. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;One used to, anonymously, operate a website called &amp;#39;Domelights&amp;#39;. It was a site where Philly cops and Highway Patrol cops and some firemen and paramedics would visit to commiserate over the difficulty of their jobs and complain about the city not taking generous enough care of themselves financially and recount stories of their interactions with the public. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;There were so many out and out racist and/or violent comments penned by cops on the website that, when the media in Philadelphia finally reported on it, some members of the public were shocked and the Bureau actively investigated the website and, with a combination of threats and cajoling the cop who started the site (he was fairly high up in the PD) finally shuttered it, which was too bad as it was a great place for those of us who aren&amp;#39;t unbalanced enough to be cops could read what those who &amp;#39;protect and serve&amp;#39; really thought of the rest of us. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I hope your family finds peace.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4620668461684248853/comments/default/8654166238362972126'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4620668461684248853/comments/default/8654166238362972126'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/09/the-enforcement-castes-war-on-women.html?showComment=1379548037247#c8654166238362972126' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/09/the-enforcement-castes-war-on-women.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4620668461684248853' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4620668461684248853' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-729996957"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 18, 2013 at 5:47 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5911854958575691446</id><published>2013-09-17T16:24:53.171-06:00</published><updated>2013-09-17T16:24:53.171-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Absolutely correct Anonymous.  NEVER speak or say ...</title><content type='html'>Absolutely correct Anonymous.  NEVER speak or say anything, innocent or otherwise.  After 50 years on this Earth in Australia with no record, I recently have had 2 incidents to jade my faith in the Law.  I had a female Police Officer submit a false document at 1.35am the morning BEFORE a Court Appearance, three months after the event.  And my wife was stalked and my family destroyed by a ex-Philadelphia Police Office AKA Ranger Tom, via a social media site from the other side of the world.  Ask me now what I think of the Badge?</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4620668461684248853/comments/default/5911854958575691446'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4620668461684248853/comments/default/5911854958575691446'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/09/the-enforcement-castes-war-on-women.html?showComment=1379456693171#c5911854958575691446' title=''/><author><name>Mark higgins</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/15092216261291684950</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/09/the-enforcement-castes-war-on-women.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4620668461684248853' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4620668461684248853' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1172215171"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 17, 2013 at 4:24 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5531381805252231389</id><published>2013-09-17T16:24:03.839-06:00</published><updated>2013-09-17T16:24:03.839-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Absolutely correct Anonymous.  NEVER speak or say ...</title><content type='html'>Absolutely correct Anonymous.  NEVER speak or say anything, innocent or otherwise.  After 50 years on this Earth in Australia with no record, I recently have had 2 incidents to jade my faith in the Law.  I had a female Police Officer submit a false document at 1.35am the morning BEFORE a Court Appearance, three months after the event.  And my wife was stalked and my family destroyed by a ex-Philadelphia Police Office AKA Ranger Tom, via a social media site from the other side of the world.  Ask me now what I think of the Badge?</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4620668461684248853/comments/default/5531381805252231389'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4620668461684248853/comments/default/5531381805252231389'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/09/the-enforcement-castes-war-on-women.html?showComment=1379456643839#c5531381805252231389' title=''/><author><name>Mark higgins</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/15092216261291684950</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/09/the-enforcement-castes-war-on-women.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4620668461684248853' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4620668461684248853' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1172215171"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 17, 2013 at 4:24 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8077896029215595917</id><published>2013-09-16T19:02:55.148-06:00</published><updated>2013-09-16T19:02:55.148-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Imagine how deranged a cop today has to be actuall...</title><content type='html'>Imagine how deranged a cop today has to be actually get brought up on charges for terrorizing people? The vast majority get away with their abuse as the department, the union, the prosecutor&amp;#39;s office and the government that employs the cop all circle the wagons in an effort to shield the nutcase from bearing any responsibility for his or her actions. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;A cop has to be inventive, in a sick way, to get himself fired for his behaviour. He has to be not only inventive but obscenely cruel to find himself facing charges from the local DA&amp;#39;s office. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Teach your children....call 911 at your own peril. NEVER, EVER EVER talk to police; whether on the street or at the station or in back of a cop car or in jail... especially if you innocent. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4620668461684248853/comments/default/8077896029215595917'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4620668461684248853/comments/default/8077896029215595917'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/09/the-enforcement-castes-war-on-women.html?showComment=1379379775148#c8077896029215595917' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/09/the-enforcement-castes-war-on-women.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4620668461684248853' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4620668461684248853' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-729996957"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 16, 2013 at 7:02 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1794011825526360251</id><published>2013-09-15T10:05:09.300-06:00</published><updated>2013-09-15T10:05:09.300-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Where are the husbands, fathers and boyfriends of ...</title><content type='html'>Where are the husbands, fathers and boyfriends of these women?  Why are the vermin responsible for these attacks still walking?</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4620668461684248853/comments/default/1794011825526360251'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4620668461684248853/comments/default/1794011825526360251'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/09/the-enforcement-castes-war-on-women.html?showComment=1379261109300#c1794011825526360251' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/09/the-enforcement-castes-war-on-women.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4620668461684248853' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4620668461684248853' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1978495431"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 15, 2013 at 10:05 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3446414575254795684</id><published>2013-09-14T12:39:17.086-06:00</published><updated>2013-09-14T12:39:17.086-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Will,&#xa;&#xa;I came across this today. Absolutely sicken...</title><content type='html'>Will,&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I came across this today. Absolutely sickening and a sign of just how bad things really are:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;http://www.fromthetrenchesworldreport.com/california-police-shoot-injured-animals-at-the-range/57500#more-57500</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4620668461684248853/comments/default/3446414575254795684'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4620668461684248853/comments/default/3446414575254795684'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/09/the-enforcement-castes-war-on-women.html?showComment=1379183957086#c3446414575254795684' title=''/><author><name>Bill in IL</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/09/the-enforcement-castes-war-on-women.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4620668461684248853' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4620668461684248853' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1922137117"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 14, 2013 at 12:39 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7687842817409224650</id><published>2013-09-12T17:06:02.868-06:00</published><updated>2013-09-12T17:06:02.868-06:00</updated><title type='text'>anon 12:11 pm:  &#xa;&#xa;your ad hominem reveals you have...</title><content type='html'>anon 12:11 pm:  &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;your ad hominem reveals you have nothing substantial to add, which, it so happens, also indicates you have LOST the word game.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;i could call you a small, sniping troll who hides behind &amp;#39;anonymous&amp;#39;, but that would put me at your level, which i refuse to even consider, so the opening to this paragraph is an example of what i would say if i were - perish the thought - at your level.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4620668461684248853/comments/default/7687842817409224650'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4620668461684248853/comments/default/7687842817409224650'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/09/the-enforcement-castes-war-on-women.html?showComment=1379027162868#c7687842817409224650' title=''/><author><name>kirk</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/09/the-enforcement-castes-war-on-women.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4620668461684248853' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4620668461684248853' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-306670635"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 12, 2013 at 5:06 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1637492446806345754</id><published>2013-09-12T13:13:11.193-06:00</published><updated>2013-09-12T13:13:11.193-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Anon 12:11PM:&#xa;&#xa;Still wearing a badge and blue cost...</title><content type='html'>Anon 12:11PM:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Still wearing a badge and blue costume and beating up old ladies and toddlers, aren&amp;#39;t you?</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4620668461684248853/comments/default/1637492446806345754'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4620668461684248853/comments/default/1637492446806345754'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/09/the-enforcement-castes-war-on-women.html?showComment=1379013191193#c1637492446806345754' title=''/><author><name>liberranter</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/00555275410576294081</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='25' height='32' src='http://1.bp.blogspot.com/-99azfmSRb8A/UPMam9DsbuI/AAAAAAAAAEQ/c391VHlU7-0/s220/pipe-smoking_curmudgeon.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/09/the-enforcement-castes-war-on-women.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4620668461684248853' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4620668461684248853' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-529179912"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 12, 2013 at 1:13 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-520955176796682511</id><published>2013-09-12T12:11:52.179-06:00</published><updated>2013-09-12T12:11:52.179-06:00</updated><title type='text'>kirk, you still live in your mothers basement ,don...</title><content type='html'>kirk, you still live in your mothers basement ,dont you? </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4620668461684248853/comments/default/520955176796682511'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4620668461684248853/comments/default/520955176796682511'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/09/the-enforcement-castes-war-on-women.html?showComment=1379009512179#c520955176796682511' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/09/the-enforcement-castes-war-on-women.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4620668461684248853' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4620668461684248853' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1712621985"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 12, 2013 at 12:11 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5093596641062290945</id><published>2013-09-12T11:26:09.036-06:00</published><updated>2013-09-12T11:26:09.036-06:00</updated><title type='text'>This is not just against women, police assault men...</title><content type='html'>This is not just against women, police assault men all the time as well. Generally any lack of cooperation while being arrested will result in police violence specially if you are unarmed. This is not a war against women, It is police fighting a war against all humanity. Man, woman, child, elderly, oh, also pets, are all in danger of abusive police. This is a very serious issue and must be stopped but to narrow it down to a women&amp;#39;s issue is to forget all other victims of this abuse. ALL police brutality must stop.&lt;br /&gt;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4620668461684248853/comments/default/5093596641062290945'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4620668461684248853/comments/default/5093596641062290945'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/09/the-enforcement-castes-war-on-women.html?showComment=1379006769036#c5093596641062290945' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/09/the-enforcement-castes-war-on-women.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4620668461684248853' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4620668461684248853' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1135819696"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 12, 2013 at 11:26 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3732924934851186087</id><published>2013-09-12T07:47:01.243-06:00</published><updated>2013-09-12T07:47:01.243-06:00</updated><title type='text'>In our neighbourhood recently an 80-year-old woman...</title><content type='html'>In our neighbourhood recently an 80-year-old woman suffering from dementia was tasered by police because she was out wandering with a knife. In the process of being &amp;quot;helped&amp;quot; she fell and broke her hip.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;http://www.thestar.com/news/crime/2013/09/06/tasering_of_80yearold_woman_with_dementia_alarms_experts.html &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Rather than harming herself, it was left to the experts.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Blessings.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4620668461684248853/comments/default/3732924934851186087'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4620668461684248853/comments/default/3732924934851186087'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/09/the-enforcement-castes-war-on-women.html?showComment=1378993621243#c3732924934851186087' title=''/><author><name>mickeyman</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/05294892836443576042</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='21' height='32' src='http://3.bp.blogspot.com/_ewOEMUwSYOo/TD5n5K4KaDI/AAAAAAAAAAY/35rxbDAQA6c/S220/Kalevala+hat+2.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/09/the-enforcement-castes-war-on-women.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4620668461684248853' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4620668461684248853' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1282442354"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 12, 2013 at 7:47 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6998660802247387695</id><published>2013-09-12T07:29:24.076-06:00</published><updated>2013-09-12T07:29:24.076-06:00</updated><title type='text'>malevolent trolls bathing in the reflected light o...</title><content type='html'>malevolent trolls bathing in the reflected light of empire have it their way now.  &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;question: what will be their fate when the reflected light of empire no longer is present?  &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;answer: they are sealing their fate by their actions in the present.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4620668461684248853/comments/default/6998660802247387695'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4620668461684248853/comments/default/6998660802247387695'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/09/the-enforcement-castes-war-on-women.html?showComment=1378992564076#c6998660802247387695' title=''/><author><name>kirk</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/09/the-enforcement-castes-war-on-women.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4620668461684248853' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4620668461684248853' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-214812776"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 12, 2013 at 7:29 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-223511862741018633</id><published>2013-09-11T20:33:20.925-06:00</published><updated>2013-09-11T20:33:20.925-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Where is the National Organization for Women? They...</title><content type='html'>Where is the National Organization for Women? They should be picketing police departments all over the country in protest over this war on women. They usually have no trouble getting worked into a lather over other less obvious &amp;quot;affronts to women&amp;quot;.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4620668461684248853/comments/default/223511862741018633'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4620668461684248853/comments/default/223511862741018633'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2